Bridge 0122: logging only (Control Center's main pass, 133-144 draws of Home behind the panel: do its draws repeat from frame to frame?). No skipping.
Hashes each render pass by field (attachments, PSO, counts, state, inline bytes, the buffer ranges draws read, texture identity) at end of encoding; one MTL2 line per size and draw class at most every 2 s.
Knob: SWEET_PASSHASH (1 backboardd only, 2 every process, otherwise off; off = one OnceLock read per encoder and a null check per draw).

